WEBVTT

00:11.782 --> 00:13.951
It's high time I chromed up.

00:14.035 --> 00:15.995
Get the fuck outta here.

00:16.078 --> 00:18.414
I already gave you the quote to sell.

00:18.497 --> 00:19.707
Not here to sell.

00:19.790 --> 00:21.625
I'm here to install.

00:21.709 --> 00:24.336
Listen. That's military grade.

00:24.420 --> 00:27.840
You either got the build
to handle it or you don't.

00:27.923 --> 00:30.593
And choom, you don't got it.

00:30.676 --> 00:33.888
Spoken like a ripper
who cares about his clients.

00:33.971 --> 00:37.516
Hah! Snarky for a kid
who can't even afford me.

00:39.185 --> 00:40.811
Fuck you.

00:41.395 --> 00:42.730
Hold on.

00:42.813 --> 00:45.274
Fuck it, man. I'll bite.

00:45.941 --> 00:48.527
I'll chip you up.

00:48.611 --> 00:51.697
But when you come crying to yank it off…

00:52.865 --> 00:57.620
'cause it's poaching your brain,
I get the Sandy for free.

00:57.703 --> 01:00.081
So, ready to rip?

02:46.061 --> 02:52.234
At the convention, Lavabre attempted
to persuade Arasaka by using the…

02:52.318 --> 02:55.821
Martinez, David.
Your tardiness has been recorded.

02:55.905 --> 02:57.740
Get a load of this guy…

02:57.823 --> 02:59.742
Is he serio--

03:01.827 --> 03:03.913
We're at school you gonk!

03:03.996 --> 03:05.998
There are cameras. Have you lost your--

03:07.249 --> 03:09.043
Afraid of getting caught?

03:09.126 --> 03:11.128
'Cause I sure ain't.

03:11.211 --> 03:12.046
Come on.

03:13.005 --> 03:14.173
Well?

03:44.245 --> 03:46.330
Ow… That hurt…

03:46.413 --> 03:50.668
Ow… What did you do?!

03:50.751 --> 03:54.171
What kind of implant is that?
You broke my nose!

03:54.755 --> 03:56.423
You're done for!

03:56.507 --> 04:00.427
My father's an Arasaka exec!
On the Academy's board!

04:00.511 --> 04:04.598
Do you know how easy it'd be
to have you expelled?

04:04.682 --> 04:06.850
Like I give a shit.

04:31.542 --> 04:33.210
Is he serio--

04:36.422 --> 04:40.592
My father's an Arasaka exec!
On the Academy's board!

04:40.676 --> 04:43.053
Do you know how easy it'd be
to have you expelled?

04:43.637 --> 04:50.561
Marcus, why am I being shown footage
of my own son being assaulted?

04:50.644 --> 04:55.441
This student is David Martinez,
17 years old, from Santo Domingo.

04:55.524 --> 04:57.318
He is a top student at the Academy,

04:57.401 --> 05:01.030
but he was found using a bootleg wreath
that corrupted the Academy's hardware.

05:01.113 --> 05:04.491
He has no father and his mother was
recently killed in a traffic accident.

05:04.575 --> 05:06.493
He owes a considerable amount of debt--

05:06.577 --> 05:07.953
How is this relevant?

05:08.037 --> 05:10.205
Notice his movements…

05:10.289 --> 05:14.960
He has the Sandevistan that James Norris
had at the time of this death.

05:15.044 --> 05:18.255
The case that was filed
as a cyberpsychotic incident.

05:18.339 --> 05:19.173
Yes, sir.

05:19.256 --> 05:24.595
Yet, unlike the soldier, this student
displays no side effects from the implant.

05:24.678 --> 05:31.060
His tolerance for cybernetics could make
him a prime candidate to test the product.

05:31.769 --> 05:34.396
I see. And where is he now?

05:34.480 --> 05:35.773
He was expelled, sir.

05:35.856 --> 05:36.940
Summon him.

05:37.024 --> 05:39.860
Lure him with the promise of
financial aid if you must.

05:39.943 --> 05:41.987
And what of your son?

05:42.071 --> 05:45.908
As my heir, it's high time he learned…

05:45.991 --> 05:48.994
what it means to serve
the company's best interests.

06:03.092 --> 06:06.386
I'm so fucked.

06:16.230 --> 06:18.899
Wash cycle complete…

07:46.236 --> 07:47.446
Come with me.

07:48.780 --> 07:50.032
The hell is your problem?

07:50.115 --> 07:51.033
What?

07:51.116 --> 07:53.327
You're messing with my work.

07:53.410 --> 07:56.914
Work? Looked more like a picksocket to me.

07:56.997 --> 07:59.041
You some kinda badge?

07:59.124 --> 08:01.668
Can't believe you're a petty thief…

08:04.713 --> 08:06.131
Do I know you?

08:06.215 --> 08:07.966
No… not really. Just--

08:11.386 --> 08:14.556
Ooh, you're in trouble.

08:14.640 --> 08:15.474
Huh?

08:15.557 --> 08:19.853
Really? A Sandevistan?
Not an off-the-rack model, either.

08:19.937 --> 08:23.690
I won't press you.
This is Night City after all…

08:23.774 --> 08:26.610
Crazy idea. How about we work together?

08:26.693 --> 08:27.903
What, stealing?

08:27.986 --> 08:30.864
I only steal from Arasaka suits.

08:30.948 --> 08:33.742
What about me then? I look corpo to you?

08:33.825 --> 08:37.246
My scan picked up an ID
from Arasaka Academy.

08:37.329 --> 08:41.416
But you're right,
you definitely don't look the type.

08:41.500 --> 08:43.961
I dropped out.

08:44.044 --> 08:46.838
Oh? A bad boy.

08:47.548 --> 08:49.716
It's just 'Saka you target?

08:50.842 --> 08:52.219
You in?

08:52.302 --> 08:55.264
Gonna break poor momma's heart, y'know.

08:56.890 --> 08:59.017
Lesson number one.

08:59.101 --> 09:01.353
Less judgment, more awareness.

09:01.436 --> 09:03.522
Yeah, yeah. So, what's my cut?

09:03.605 --> 09:06.358
We'll split the haul 80-20.

09:06.441 --> 09:10.862
Fuck that. Don't you need my Sandevistan?

09:10.946 --> 09:13.365
But I'm the one pushing
the klepped shards.

09:13.448 --> 09:15.909
Plus, now I have a trainee to supervise.

09:15.993 --> 09:17.536
Trainee…?

09:17.619 --> 09:21.415
I'm actually tight on eddies right now.
Can't we do 60-40?

09:22.207 --> 09:26.753
70-30. And I'll pay you
the second the job's done.

09:28.297 --> 09:29.464
Fine.

09:29.548 --> 09:30.674
It's a deal.

09:31.508 --> 09:32.426
Call me Lucy.

09:34.094 --> 09:35.304
David.

10:47.834 --> 10:49.961
So? How did I do?

10:50.045 --> 10:52.839
I'd say you're well worth the 20%.

10:52.923 --> 10:54.341
It's 30!

10:54.424 --> 10:55.842
Kidding.

10:56.718 --> 10:58.345
Keep it rolling on another car?

10:58.428 --> 11:02.641
Maybe a different line.
By now, someone's probably noticed.

11:02.724 --> 11:04.601
We should keep the risk to a minimum…

11:07.604 --> 11:08.855
How bad?

11:08.939 --> 11:10.524
Rookie mistake.

11:10.607 --> 11:14.111
Hasn't taken any precautions
since installing that implant.

11:14.194 --> 11:16.071
Which immunosuppressant is he on?

11:16.863 --> 11:18.490
He insured?

11:18.573 --> 11:21.868
No clue. Doesn't look like he would be.

11:21.952 --> 11:25.664
Any family or guardian? Anyone I can call?

11:25.747 --> 11:28.875
Dunno. Parents, I guess.

11:28.959 --> 11:30.752
He used to go to the Academy.

11:30.836 --> 11:34.089
Arasaka? No wonder he could afford this.

11:34.172 --> 11:36.133
Hold on…

11:37.092 --> 11:40.011
Hey. How ya feeling?

11:40.637 --> 11:42.347
I'm gonna be sick…

11:42.431 --> 11:44.266
Which immunosuppressant do you take?

11:44.975 --> 11:46.268
Immuno… what?

11:48.353 --> 11:49.771
Wow, man…

11:49.855 --> 11:51.106
You're psycho.

11:55.277 --> 11:57.154
Hey, we passed the…

11:57.237 --> 11:58.447
Oh my.

11:58.530 --> 12:02.409
Listen, choom, the kid's got
an implant that'll fetch a nice price.

12:02.492 --> 12:04.035
Just sit back, relax and--

12:04.119 --> 12:07.289
What? You cut a deal
with the Scavengers or something?

12:07.372 --> 12:10.041
Sit back or I'll take your chrome, too.

12:10.125 --> 12:11.585
Sorry, David.

12:11.668 --> 12:14.796
Looks like your cut's down to 20.

12:29.352 --> 12:30.896
Let's go!

12:49.372 --> 12:50.290
Whoops.

12:50.373 --> 12:53.460
Hey, not dying, are ya?

12:53.543 --> 12:54.794
Doc…

12:54.878 --> 12:55.962
Huh?

12:56.046 --> 12:58.548
Doc's clinic… Please… take…

13:08.683 --> 13:10.060
David, buddy…

13:10.143 --> 13:13.063
You look like shit.

13:13.146 --> 13:14.231
Thanks…

13:15.482 --> 13:16.942
How many times you use it?

13:17.025 --> 13:19.319
Six… No, eight?

13:19.402 --> 13:21.363
Jesus Henry Christ!

13:21.446 --> 13:24.157
A grown-ass man
couldn't take that punishment.

13:24.241 --> 13:26.243
I was fine…

13:26.326 --> 13:28.453
But then my nose popped a cork.

13:29.037 --> 13:32.207
This gonk didn't know about
immunosuppressants.

13:33.083 --> 13:35.210
Didn't see the need.

13:35.293 --> 13:39.297
Of course you didn't.
Just sell him the meds.

13:39.381 --> 13:42.300
Shit off the shelf's not gonna cut it.
It'll cost ya.

13:42.384 --> 13:43.802
You good for it?

13:43.885 --> 13:45.554
You charging me?

13:45.637 --> 13:49.808
Fucking right I am!
Ain't running no charity.

13:50.767 --> 13:51.977
How much'll these buy?

13:53.770 --> 13:54.938
Two days' worth.

13:56.231 --> 13:57.482
That's it?

13:57.566 --> 13:59.359
Plenty of other rippers out there.

13:59.442 --> 14:02.904
Of course, that might land you
back with the Scavs.

14:04.030 --> 14:05.991
Greedy bastard…

14:09.286 --> 14:11.997
You really don't want it gone?

14:12.080 --> 14:13.206
Nope.

14:13.873 --> 14:18.712
Still can't believe it…
Eight times in one goddamn day.

14:18.795 --> 14:21.006
You're either a total masochist or…

14:21.089 --> 14:26.636
Listen. Don't use it more than
two times a day. Three max.

14:26.720 --> 14:29.806
Even if your body can take it,
that egghead of yours can't.

14:29.890 --> 14:34.269
Your brain's gonna get scrambled.

14:35.395 --> 14:38.607
A single implant
could make me a cyberpsycho?

14:38.690 --> 14:42.193
Never heard anything like that before.

14:42.277 --> 14:43.528
Goes to show you…

14:43.612 --> 14:46.031
just how dangerous that thing is.

15:03.840 --> 15:05.050
All done?

15:05.133 --> 15:06.343
Yeah.

15:06.426 --> 15:08.887
Guess that's a wrap for today.

15:08.970 --> 15:10.722
I can keep going.

15:10.805 --> 15:15.060
No way, I'm not babysitting a cyberpsycho.

15:15.644 --> 15:18.897
Only use the Sandevistan
when you really need to.

15:18.980 --> 15:20.815
Lots of other ways to churn out eds.

15:21.733 --> 15:24.027
Still willing to work with me
after all that?

15:24.110 --> 15:26.947
Think I'd let you go
without being paid back first?

15:29.866 --> 15:32.577
Well, good. I need the eddies.

15:32.661 --> 15:33.870
That's the spirit.

15:35.538 --> 15:40.085
Sure you're not up for more tonight?
I'm kinda lagging on rent.

15:40.168 --> 15:42.879
No more today. Quit asking.

15:43.546 --> 15:44.923
Okay…

15:48.468 --> 15:49.469
Come with me.

15:49.552 --> 15:51.471
I knew you wanted to!

15:51.554 --> 15:53.306
Not work-related.

15:53.932 --> 15:54.891
Huh?

15:56.518 --> 15:57.519
Right here.

15:57.602 --> 16:00.230
You, uh… live alone?

16:00.313 --> 16:01.398
Yeah?

16:02.148 --> 16:02.983
Huh.

16:04.526 --> 16:06.194
Wait, are you nervous?

16:06.277 --> 16:07.112
No.

16:07.654 --> 16:08.780
Your first time?

16:08.863 --> 16:09.781
No.

16:11.282 --> 16:12.492
Hey, fuck off!

16:13.284 --> 16:14.244
Take a seat.

16:15.036 --> 16:16.913
I've only got beer. You drink?

16:16.997 --> 16:18.498
Uh, yeah.

16:18.581 --> 16:19.749
Cheers.

16:28.341 --> 16:31.886
Seriously? You've never drunk before?

16:31.970 --> 16:34.014
No, I have. It's just…

16:34.889 --> 16:37.267
I don't like carbonated drinks or smokes.

16:37.892 --> 16:39.936
Do people like that really exist?

16:40.020 --> 16:41.271
I'm not lying.

16:41.354 --> 16:44.190
Sure you aren't.
And what's up with that getup anyway?

16:47.819 --> 16:48.695
Take it off.

16:48.778 --> 16:50.238
What? Why?

16:50.321 --> 16:52.240
Just do it. Come on.

16:52.323 --> 16:53.158
H-Hey!

16:57.120 --> 16:58.872
Don't mess with that…

17:01.082 --> 17:02.709
Edgerunners?

17:02.792 --> 17:05.170
It's another word for cyberpunk.

17:05.253 --> 17:07.047
It's who you wanna be, right?

17:08.298 --> 17:11.051
I'm actually a fan of JK's
"EDGERUNNERS" series.

17:12.260 --> 17:13.303
You serious?

17:14.637 --> 17:15.805
Look who's talking.

17:15.889 --> 17:18.683
What's up with that tacky poster?

17:20.226 --> 17:21.186
You got a problem?

17:21.269 --> 17:25.065
Uh… no problem.

17:25.690 --> 17:29.944
Just always whacked me how those ads
make it seem like some kind of paradise.

17:30.028 --> 17:33.448
I mean, lots of peeps died trying to
turn that dumb rock into something useful.

17:34.032 --> 17:36.076
Sounds more like a prison than paradise.

17:37.202 --> 17:38.828
Sounds like someone did their homework.

17:40.038 --> 17:44.000
The Academy teaches you things
they don't show in the ads.

17:44.084 --> 17:47.045
As expected of a preppy Academy boy.

17:47.670 --> 17:49.464
It's not like that.

17:49.547 --> 17:52.342
Isn't it? Never caught a pleb
attending a 'Saka school.

17:52.425 --> 17:53.551
It's not!

17:57.388 --> 18:00.475
My mom and I, we weren't well off.

18:00.558 --> 18:03.353
The Academy normally
wouldn't have taken me.

18:04.104 --> 18:08.733
But my mom had to work real
damn hard to keep me in.

18:09.400 --> 18:14.114
You wanna know the kicker though?
I knew from day one that I'd never belong.

18:14.197 --> 18:17.575
Then why did you stick around for so long?

18:17.659 --> 18:22.580
Good fucking question. Guess it's 'cause
Mom wanted me to get a 'Saka job,

18:22.664 --> 18:24.499
climb the corporate ladder…

18:24.582 --> 18:29.587
That was her wish… Or dream, I guess.

18:29.671 --> 18:31.381
That's why.

18:32.340 --> 18:34.843
That's not your dream, though.

18:34.926 --> 18:35.760
Not my dream?

18:36.344 --> 18:39.013
Well, yeah. You and your mom
are two different people.

18:39.931 --> 18:42.350
Why should you need to work for her dream?

18:43.184 --> 18:45.770
There's nothing wrong with that.

18:45.854 --> 18:48.148
You have to find your own dream.

18:48.690 --> 18:51.526
Sounds like you've found yours.

18:53.403 --> 18:54.529
You're joking.

18:54.612 --> 18:59.826
You called it a prison, but to me,
this city is a whole lot worse.

19:00.451 --> 19:01.619
Here?

19:02.370 --> 19:04.789
I just wanna go away as far as possible.

19:08.042 --> 19:09.502
Lemme show you something.

19:24.934 --> 19:27.687
Whoa! Check the resolution on this!

19:27.770 --> 19:29.689
I can feel the fucking sun!

19:29.772 --> 19:33.693
It connects through your personal link
to let you feel the sun's heat.

19:33.776 --> 19:36.946
Of course, you'd burn to a crisp
if it was the real temperature,

19:37.030 --> 19:40.450
so I made sure to tweak it down.

19:41.326 --> 19:42.327
Want me to change it back?

19:42.410 --> 19:44.329
No, this is fun!

19:45.580 --> 19:46.831
You look ridiculous!

19:53.421 --> 19:54.547
Pretty cool, huh?

19:54.631 --> 19:56.257
This is amazing!

19:56.341 --> 19:57.383
Isn't it?

19:59.719 --> 20:00.845
Over here.

21:28.641 --> 21:31.352
First time I've ever shown anyone this.

21:31.436 --> 21:33.187
Oh… really?

21:34.731 --> 21:38.401
So, like… why me?

21:39.193 --> 21:43.448
No idea. Guess it just felt right.

21:45.825 --> 21:47.118
You know…

21:47.744 --> 21:49.704
I think we'd make a good team.

21:51.247 --> 21:52.665
Yeah…

22:07.472 --> 22:08.306
Huh?

22:10.433 --> 22:14.270
Hate to break it to ya,
but that implant belongs to me.

22:15.021 --> 22:17.148
I'll be taking it back now.
